/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (Unleash your creativity and storytelling skills at Pic Saga, where participants craft a compelling story through the lens of a camera, using a series of photographs to convey emotions, narratives, and ideas. Each participant or team will conceptualize, capture, and present a photo series that weaves a captivating tale. From framing to sequencing, every image will be a piece of your story. Our expert mentors will be available to guide you on visual storytelling techniques, ensuring your narrative resonates powerfully .The event culminates in an exciting showcase, where the most creative and impactful photo stories will be recognized and celebrated.)
/E (Unleash your creativity and storytelling skills at Pic Saga, where participants craft a compelling story through the lens of a camera, using a series of photographs to convey emotions, narratives, and ideas. Each participant or team will conceptualize, capture, and present a photo series that weaves a captivating tale. From framing to sequencing, every image will be a piece of your story. Our expert mentors will be available to guide you on visual storytelling techniques, ensuring your narrative resonates powerfully .The event culminates in an exciting showcase, where the most creative and impactful photo stories will be recognized and celebrated.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [18]
